## Tietokantarakenne

### Taulut
- `user_profiles` - Käyttäjäprofiilit (subscription_status, email, full_name)
- `message_usage` - Päivittäinen viestien käyttö (user_id, date, message_count)
- `user_subscriptions` - Stripe-tilaukset (stripe_customer_id, stripe_subscription_id, status, current_period_end)
- `flashcard_decks` - Korttipakat (source_type: text/pdf, source_filename, source_file_size)
- `flashcards` - Yksittäiset kortit (deck_id, front, back, SRS fields: interval_days, repetitions, ease_factor, last_reviewed_at, next_review_at, quality)
- `user_streaks` - Päivittäiset streak-tiedot (user_id, current_streak, longest_streak, last_activity_date, total_completions)
- `user_featured_decks` - Suosikkipakkat (user_id, deck_id, position 1-3)
- `documents` - Akatemia dokumentit (user_id, filename, file_size, status, created_at)
- `document_pages` - Dokumenttien sivut (doc_id, page_number, text, created_at)
- `document_highlights` - Käyttäjän korostukset (doc_id, page_number, text, coordinates, created_at)
- `document_sessions` - Dokumenttien lukusessiot (doc_id, user_id, current_page, started_at, updated_at)
- `quizzes` - Generoidut tentit (doc_id, topic, created_at)
- `quiz_questions` - Tenttikysymykset (quiz_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation)
- `chat_messages` - Akatemia chat-viestit (doc_id, user_id, role, content, message_type: text/mindmap/summary, mindmap_xml, mindmap_node_count, summary_text, summary_key_points TEXT[], summary_word_count, metadata, created_at) - metadata JSONB for transcript segments, mindmap support with 50-node limit constraint, summary support with key points array
- `api_rate_limits` - API rate limiting (user_id, endpoint, created_at) - uusi taulu rajoitusten seurantaan
- `supadata_usage_logs` - Supadata.ai API usage tracking (video_id, user_id, provider, success, cost_estimate, segments_count, created_at)
- `ai_response_cache` - AI vastausten välimuisti (query_hash, request_type, response_data JSONB, token_count, hit_count, expires_at, metadata) - Feature 0049, 50% kustannussäästö
- `ai_cost_tracking` - AI kustannusten seuranta (date, request_type, from_cache BOOLEAN, tokens_used, estimated_cost) - Feature 0049, kustannussäästön mittaus

